    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. So if the crystals are just becoming unstable and recrystallizing, is there a specific temperature curve I should be following for a 70% dark? I want to make sure I'm hitting the right peaks and valleys to stabilize those crystals properly.",
